## Install

Requires Python ≥ 3.11 and [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/).

```bash
uv sync
<% if (it.docs && it.docs.contentMode !== "embedded") { %>uv run server.py --refresh   # downloads the documentation on this machine (uses npx)
<% } %>```

